    "finding": "Empty-output validation applies only to standard single-agent phases. A parallel phase can return zero results or reviewers with blank text and is still marked success, allowing pipeline-completed with no usable review artifact.",
    "suggested_fix": "Apply meaningful-output validation to parallel results as well, requiring at least one nonblank agent result and marking the phase failed otherwise."
